 {:db/id "q-26804/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6552390f-0aa6-511d-8375-943b6916df9b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-26804/selection/9ace889b33b8b46f11fae996abedee11ea4458dca42824bc6dc46bf125b97a59" :answer-field/choices ["q-26804/selection/d2ccd511fa7113e14dd12e2429895ea3b07577f0e78a2dd8c4e65251bf5ab224" "q-26804/selection/035f93a2b9bf6f49403a45ba36d71e78c1bd981ecc3ed9f72143ae01e6e31109" "q-26804/selection/74322f923f68178c3aa2d92644e7f146b921777cc86b11a05a00c7c8bfd3c4fa" "q-26804/selection/9ace889b33b8b46f11fae996abedee11ea4458dca42824bc6dc46bf125b97a59" "q-26804/selection/4608ae9bcdfa38b7f6d08840164124fad9ec8b5f97dc31d7ec2e9b3e399b7364"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-26804" :question/id #uuid "579a4ba5-6e28-50c1-a811-da98f7d3570b" :question/math-academy-id "q-26804" :question/is-example false :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13930907/assets/b05d0a8e3d11d2fb1fe9018b17962f3c3cd7137bd91739a249d3bbe28371366b.png)\n\nThe graph above shows the curve $y={25}^{x}+c.$ Determine the value of $c$ and find the equation of the curve." :question/worked-solution "The horizontal asymptote of $y={25}^{x}$ is $y=0.$ The vertical translation $y={25}^{x}+c$ shifts the asymptote to $y=c.$\n\nIn the graph above, the horizontal asymptote is $y=10.$ Therefore, $c=10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-26804/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "79daf9dd-814d-562b-b3bc-b066bd2dfb90"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-26804"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-30873/selection/e7be667b169b427ee0f130ed71f0c3be625ae150824dcdee7661cb840a3b7471" :answer/id #uuid "9fbf5137-c803-5553-ba3b-18df4bc5a91e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-30873/selection/9ee2de98ba4e4a9c68394f1b6659fc9eb22